# Only MuseStudio's own files are tracked (2026-11-04: the repository holds MuseStudio, not the Godot app).
# (this machine's own project notes: README.local.md, DECISIONS.md - not tracked)
# Everything else stays on this machine:
#  - the Godot app, its tools and the copied KoikatsuOfGodot data (original-derived)
#  - MuseStudio/game (the original's Studio, linked) and the original-derived data
#    (MuseStudio/data: plays, talk, locations, sounds, touch - remade from the original by MuseStudio/tools)
#  - personal state: the persona ledger, relationship and moods, replays (all under MuseStudio/game/UserData),
#    session records (bridge/cache), browser profiles (launcher/profiles), Muse's notes (from_muse, for_muse)
#  - this machine's settings (bridge_config.json, panel_config.json: tracked as *.example.json)
/*
!/.gitignore
!/.gitattributes
!/MUSE_GUIDE.md
!/MUSE_GUIDE_quick/
!/MUSE_GUIDE_plays.md
# Muse's trees (the notice of 2026-11-04: Muse adds them by pull requests; this side never edits them)
!/README.md
!/BOOTSTRAP.md
!/claude-setup/
!/skills/
!/docs/

!/MuseStudio/
/MuseStudio/*
!/MuseStudio/README.md
!/MuseStudio/src/
!/MuseStudio/tools/
/MuseStudio/tools/original_path.txt
!/MuseStudio/data/
/MuseStudio/data/plays.json
/MuseStudio/data/talk.json
/MuseStudio/data/locations.json
/MuseStudio/data/sounds.json
/MuseStudio/data/touch.json

!/bridge/
/bridge/*
!/bridge/bridge.py
!/bridge/irodori_client.py
!/bridge/kk_card.py
!/bridge/muse_match.py
!/bridge/muse_listener.py
!/bridge/labels.py
!/bridge/room_labels.json
!/bridge/static/
!/bridge/tests/
!/bridge/bridge_config.example.json

!/launcher/
/launcher/*
!/launcher/panel_manager.py
!/launcher/start.cmd
!/launcher/panel_config.example.json
!/launcher/make_shortcut.py
!/launcher/icons/
!/launcher/tests/

__pycache__/
*.pyc
